Third-party material in hax-lean
================================

HaxLean/Rust.lean and the modules under HaxLean/Rust/
------------------------------------------------------

These modules are a port of part of the Lean standard library of Aeneas
(the `Aeneas.Std` namespace), taken from the Cryspen fork of Aeneas:

  Repository: https://github.com/cryspen/aeneas
  Commit:     6852e6474ec508930acba4df79977b3483a10d10
  Directory:  backends/lean/Aeneas/Std/ (and Aeneas/Data/List/List.lean,
              Aeneas/Tactic/Solver/Arith/Lemmas.lean)
  License:    Apache License, Version 2.0
  Copyright:  the Aeneas contributors

The port targets Lean v4.33.1 without Mathlib. Declaration names and
signatures follow the source; proofs that used Mathlib or the Aeneas
tactics were rewritten against the Lean core library, and declarations
that depend on Mathlib or on the Aeneas tactic framework were omitted.
Each ported file names its source files in its header.
`scripts/aeneas-port-drift.sh` lists the declaration names that differ
between each ported file and its source files.

